# game.saves = files: the same pin from the F1 Saves page as swap.press, made during a race: the pak is not
# swapped there (a race holds the pak's records: docs/port/SAVES.md 5.1), and the next start builds it with the pin.
# Run by tools/port/saves_check.py's swap scenario.
# until: 0x400000:400
# seconds: 90
# realtime
# args: --saves files (tools/port/saves_check.py runs it, in a data folder of its own)
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 A           # the track select
23 A           # the car select; the race from about 26 s
30 MENU        # F1 over the main menu
30.6 DOWN 0.1  # Video, Audio, Keyboard, Controllers, Game, Saves
30.9 DOWN 0.1
31.2 DOWN 0.1
31.5 DOWN 0.1
31.8 DOWN 0.1
32.2 A 0.1     # the Saves page: Player, Kept as, Folder, Import ghosts, Export to the .mpk, then the saves
32.6 DOWN 0.1
32.9 DOWN 0.1
33.2 DOWN 0.1
33.5 DOWN 0.1
33.8 DOWN 0.1
34.1 DOWN 0.1  # the second ghost, the slower
34.5 A 0.1     # its page: Kind, Player, Track, Time, Car, Pages, On the pak, File, Pin to the pak
34.9 DOWN 0.1
35.2 DOWN 0.1
35.5 DOWN 0.1
35.8 DOWN 0.1
36.1 DOWN 0.1
36.4 DOWN 0.1
36.7 DOWN 0.1
37 DOWN 0.1
37.4 A 0.1     # pinned
38 START       # the overlay closes; the pak goes out at the next flush and back in after the game's poll
